qa_pairs.explanation:
1. Extract the total transaction volume of 295.9 billion yuan in 2024 from the 'Trend of Skincare Product Retail Sales Scale';
2. Extract the online share of 43% in 2024 from the 'Comparison of Online and Offline Channel Shares of Skincare Products from 2022 - 2024';
3. Calculate: 295.9 × 0.43 = 127.137 billion yuan, rounded to 127.14 billion yuan.

1. It is known that the retail sales volume of online channels in 2024 is 1271.37 billion yuan;
2. Extract the proportion of Douyin, which is 45%, from the 'Proportion and Growth Rate of Core Online Channels in Skincare Business';
3. Calculate: 1271.37 × 0.45 = 572.1165 billion yuan, rounded to 572.12 billion yuan.

1. From the share comparison, the online share in 2024 (43%) - the online share in 2023 (41%) = an increase of 2%;
2. The total retail sales volume in 2024 is 2959 billion yuan;
3. Calculate the new - added online sales: 2959 × 2% = 59.18 billion yuan.
